contentText:
Even if they&#8217;re not sharing the stage of writing bops in the studio, Kelly Rowland&#8217;s bond with her Destiny&#8217;s Child running mates, Beyoncé and Michelle Williams , has only strengthened over the years.

Rowland joined The Jennifer Hudson Show on Thursday (Nov. 12), where she detailed how she&#8217;s locked in for life with Bey and &#8216;Chelle, comparing their friendship to being as tight-knit as a marriage.

